@@ -0,0 +1,60 @@
+# 界面目标的最终释放
+
+状态：实现中。消费 App 需要每轮独立目标；原 `close` 保留可查询的关闭项，不能用它代表最终释放。
+
+需求主人是 [观察与动作](../product/requirements/modules/ui-control/observe-act.md)，实现主人仍是 `ui-control` 与原 Effect/Pending 链。Molis Work 第 39 批将每轮操作绑定原授权，轮次结束后需要释放这些绑定；这不是新增审批或运行内核。
+
+## 合同
+
+- `UiControl.detach(ref): Promise<void>` 立即禁止目标的新观察、准备和派发，并从目标清单移除。重复调用安全；并发调用等待同一次清理，结束后不保留永久 tombstone。
+- detach 清掉本目标的观察与计划索引，尚未派出的原 Effect 走原 `EffectChain.cancel`，原 Pending 等待者被唤醒。清理等待在途准备保存和这些取消收口；已派出的操作继续由原链结算，可能已发生的效果不能说成未发生。
+- `close(ref)` 保留既有 get/list 的 closed 行及返回形状，但关闭在最后一次等待后仍必须被观察、准备和派发检查到。close 与 detach 共用同一在途 driver.close，成功关闭不重复；关闭失败如实返回，不恢复目标权限，显式重试沿原 driver 再清理。driver 的最终关闭应允许失败后的重试，不改投新的目标。
+- 观察在发布资源前复核原 target/epoch，准备在 assess 后和原写 lane 进入 Host 提交前复核，派发在原 claim 后、进入 driver 前复核。已进入 Host 提交的原记录落定后如目标失效，只沿原 effect 取消，不发布新审批；目标失效后的新 Host 提交被拒绝。
+- 为原 prepare 增加可选的第四参数 `assertCurrent: () => void`，由 Effect owner 在写队列及 StoredPolicy 最后调用 Host.commitBatch 前执行。同步抛错或返回 Promise 均拒绝。只传进程内控制，不保存、不进入 proposal；既有调用不变，Run 授权包装必须转交它。Node Host 的 commitBatch 在该调用栈内完成写入；其他异步 Host 已接受的提交沿原结果收口，不以事后撤销声称从未提交。
+- 异步 Host 的已接受提交是实际存在的原记录，取消收口期间直接存储回读可能看到它；本合同不声称能让已经接受的远端提交从未存在。保证的是 Surface 不返回新可执行 proposal、不发布新的 onAwaiting 审批事件、已失效目标永不进入 driver。取消失败时 detach 报错并保留原 effect 引用供再次取消，不把清理失败说成成功。Node 同栈提交路径另由 UID-04 证明失效前尚未交给 Host 的记录为零。
+- 写入前拒绝可重试原取消；已经写入却失去响应时，原 prepare 的 observation fingerprint/错误或原 effect 引用持续保留，后续 detach 不能因没有新引用而成功。无法核清的提交必须走原 Runtime 恢复，再按原记录处理；本片不增加通用存储核对或第二套版本账。SDK 进入界面关机阶段时先同步封住新 attach/detach，已接受的 detach 仍可加入原尝试；关闭原 targets，等待已开始的最终释放和关闭目标在途准备，再关闭存储。清理无法核清时关机如实拒绝，不把未知结果算成功。未 detach 的原 closed 行和既有等待保留原关闭语义，关机不擅自取消它们。
+- 未知准备只认原持久化边界的私有失败标记：进入存储调用后仍无法判断的结果才记录，写前授权/形状拒绝和明确未写码不会永久阻断目标。标记只活在这次错误上，不落盘、不成为公开错误合同。原未知 fingerprint 在入口和同一写队列的最终检查都禁止重试，不能因链的成功索引未安装而新建第二笔。关机封口后，失败的最后清理 Promise 也继续可加入，不能在 drain 后重新发起。
+- 原资源正文及历史 Effect/Pending 由各自 owner 管，不因 detach 删除持久事实。不存在的 target 不恢复、不新造。重新使用须 attach 新目标，旧观察永远不能用于它。
+
+## 范围与专业边界
+
+改动限 UI 控制、Effect 准备的同步提交检查与原装配转交、公共 API 快照、相关合同和测试。无新物理包、槽、配置、版本、读取兼容或迁移。driver 仍由 App 注入；最终释放是不可绕过的生命周期边界，App 决定何时调用，终端用户的授权与界面仍归 App。本片不更改实际浏览器或桌面输入协议。
+
+## 验收
+
+- UID-01：保留 close 的可查询语义；detach 后 get/list/targetOfObservation 不再返回该目标，重复/并发 detach 只关闭一次；后续 attach 正常。
+- UID-02：capture、redact、assess 等待中关闭或 detach 后不发布观察、不生成新提案；原 Effect 写 lane 等待中失效不发出新 Host commit。
+- UID-03：已有尚未派出审批被原链取消，原等待者醒来；派发 claim 期间 detach 后 driver 调用为零；已进 driver 的操作保留原真实结果或未知，不重放。
+- UID-04：真实 Node 存储读取证明准备在最终提交前失效时没有 Effect/Pending 行；成功和取消各有可恢复的原记录。受控 driver 证明生命周期，不冒充真实 OS 操作验收；实际 App 派发消费由 Molis Work 本批验证。
+
+中途只运行本片新用例，构建与用例经消费仓库 machine-slot 单份运行；最终按两个仓库受影响范围统一复核，不运行全量。制包前核公共 API、干净构建和同一评审代理的最终头。产物只供已授权的 Molis Work 隔离分支采用，不发布。
+
+2026-11-13 工程证据：`packages/sdk/test/ui-surface-detach.live.test.ts` 的 41 条新增用例通过，含真实临时 Node 存储与重启；SDK build、新文件及其生产依赖的 TypeScript 检查、公共 API 快照检查、对准确基线 `1cc80b05253df798eeb34afff65d1bda06bee587` 的 quality ratchet、活文档链接检查通过。同一 GPT-6.1 high 只读代理已通过初版最终释放代码（本地提交 `9a1fb2c98a09e84a7716d50b9ce78c883b0f966a`）的复审及 C 合审；新增原轮授权边界仍由同一代理按最终源码复核，不沿用初版通过结论。运行工具为 Node 24.15.0、pnpm 11.9.0，未修改仓库引擎或版本约定。既有 UI/Effect/Runtime 回归和消费 App 实操仍按本批统一收尾安排；未跑 SDK 全量 quality 或真实桌面/浏览器操作，不将本片证据当作 Molis 端到端交付。
+
+### Original round authority at the final fence
+
+`UiSurface.assertCurrent?()` is a synchronous, process-local check supplied by the attaching owner. The existing target/epoch checks invoke it after awaits and at the original EffectChain queue and Node storage commit; a thenable is refused. A transient denial does not detach the target or invent a terminal outcome. Only an explicit close/detach or Runtime shutdown ends the binding.
+
+The composition-owned surface guard captures that same target and epoch. The existing `surface-act` tool rechecks it after the clock wait and immediately before publishing typed text. `surface-observe` rechecks after reading the observation resource, before returning its body. No resource-store ownership or separate permission ledger is added. UID-02 exercises both real Node commit fences and the public system tool/resource path; a denied prepare is not, by itself, evidence about resource publication or delivery.
+
+`SystemToolInput.surfaces.guard?` is also an optional public constructor input reachable through `createSystemToolRunner`: it captures a synchronous check for the original target or observation. Runtime composition supplies it from the same UiControl owner; hosts constructing their own system runner supply the same original authority fence. It is not a new public method on `UiControl` or `Runtime`. The optional input and `UiSurface.assertCurrent` are included in the public API snapshot. Existing standalone three-argument effect preparations are unchanged.
+
+Both the driver authority and the optional public system-tool guard reject thenables, including rejected promises. The public constructor tests assert zero text staging and zero observation-body reads; the guard does not silently continue after an asynchronous return.
+
+
+### Original target and cancellation across calls (UID-05–08)
+
+The attaching driver receives a frozen `UiExpectedTarget` on observe, assess and perform. It contains the original identity/scope plus a synchronous original-target/epoch/cancellation check. The driver compares it before reading or injecting, retains the original low-level session/window and carries the check through its awaits and final native dispatch. These are trusted in-process values, never model/page input, persistent observation fields or log output. App-switch invalidates prior observations and gives only its own dispatch the new epoch; destination authority still comes from the original action.
+
+`observe` and `prepare` accept the same optional synchronous boolean `cancelled` predicate as `perform`. Observe's predicate ends with that read/publication/delivery; it is not inherited by later actions. Prepare's predicate remains on its original plan and is ORed with perform's predicate; once seen cancelled or invalid, later false/missing values cannot revive it. An arbitrary external approval Promise need not wake just because a predicate changes; checks refuse at the next existing boundary. Original dispatched receipts, including partial effects, are not replaced by a later cancellation.
+
+`reviewTarget(exactEffectRef)` reads the existing plan/effect indexes, verifies kind/id/revision and returns the original target/expected only while awaiting approval and still current. The returned guard also checks the original plan and effect entry, but does not require the effect to remain awaiting: a trusted adapter may recheck it after accepting the original decision. It is neither a permission nor an assertion that the external OS window remains unchanged; the consuming driver must check its current original window before using the result. No second effect index, stored format, plugin slot or public observation output is added.
+
+- UID-05: original identity/scope reaches observe/assess/perform across readiness, scope and effect-claim waits; mismatched driver target refuses with no wrong-source bytes or business input.
+- UID-06: per-call cancellation during observation/redaction, preparation/approval and input-body waits refuses further publication or input; invalid predicates fail closed; one finished observation's cancellation does not cancel a later action.
+- UID-07: reviewTarget rejects wrong kind/revision, non-awaiting, cancelled, stale, detached and shutdown plans; its original guard remains valid after acceptance but cannot become valid for a replacement plan.
+- UID-08: app-switch can execute once under its new epoch while prior observations and review guards become stale; known dispatched results and original cleanup keep their existing receipt semantics.
+
+The first accepted preparation fixes an internal effect reference and plan before waiting for cleanup or approval. Duplicate requests retain that plan and cannot substitute their own cancellation. Approval callbacks only wake the caller: the returned proposal is read from the original EffectChain, never from a callback's replacement reference or reported state. Perform similarly fixes its exact reference before any wait. Shutdown seals new approval-tail cancellations and drains those already accepted without waiting for arbitrary external approval callbacks.
+
+Molis Work's batch 39 user approved this additional SDK scope on 2026-11-14; the same reviewer approved the optional cancellation parameters as the minimal completion of that scope. No version, release, real Home, unrelated upstream or compatibility changes are included. On 2026-11-14, the 47 new `ui-surface-target.live.test.ts` cases, SDK build, strict TypeScript check of that file and dependencies, public API check, quality ratchet against `1cc80b05253df798eeb34afff65d1bda06bee587` and live-document links passed. The same GPT-6.1 high reviewer approved this supplement's code and C contract after the original-reference, duplicate-preparation and shutdown-tail findings were fixed. These are local SDK engineering results, not Molis Host consumption, real OS input or product acceptance; prior tests and full regressions remain for the batch's final verification.
