+An attaching owner may supply synchronous `UiSurface.assertCurrent()` for its original round authority. The existing target/epoch fences invoke it before new observations, proposals and dispatch, including the EffectChain's final storage check. Promise-returning guards are refused. Composition retains that exact target guard for the system tool's typed-resource publication and observation-body delivery. A failed check denies the operation without implicitly closing or detaching the target; explicit lifecycle calls still own cleanup.
